name numerica-tables
category Package
revision 61288
shortdesc Create multi-column tables of mathematical functions
longdesc The package defines a command to create possibly multi-column
longdesc tables of mathematical function values. Key = value settings
longdesc produce a wide variety of table styles consistent with the
longdesc booktabs package (required). Also required are the packages
longdesc numerica(v.2), l3kernel, l3packages, amsmath and mathtools.
